const VN_W = new Set("andrea anja anke anna annette astrid barbara beate bettina birgit brigitte britta carmen christa christiane christina claudia cornelia dagmar daniela doris edith elisabeth elke erika eva gabi gabriele gerda gisela gudrun hannelore heike helga helene heidi ilse inge ingrid iris irmgard jutta karin katharina kerstin kirsten klara lena margarete maria marianne marion martina monika nicole petra regina reinhilde renate rita rosemarie ruth sabine sandra silke simone sonja stefanie susanne tanja ulrike ursula ute vera waltraud weronika winny".split(" "));
